{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>張繼聰與謝安琪（Kay）為圈中模範夫妻，19歲大仔張瞻（James）完成中學課程後，早前已離開家人前往澳洲升學，入讀教育及科學雙學位課程「Bachelor of Education &amp; Bachelor of Science – Primary Education」。張繼聰和謝安琪更帶埋細女Kakaball一齊送哥哥去澳洲上學。不知不覺原來早前張瞻又回到香港，探完家人後再飛返澳洲。謝安琪不捨分享與大仔的合照，坦言每次送機都心情低落。</p><figure><img alt=\"謝安琪張繼聰結婚多年一直恩愛。（IG@Kaytse）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260531/1137722687091642368816750.jpeg/t9UGDElqDexVfc3IOerLHRIEqWXyj1N_QvHvP0Lx7z8\"/><figcaption>謝安琪張繼聰結婚多年一直恩愛。（IG@Kaytse）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"謝安琪曬出全家福。（IG@kaytse）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260503/1127663528128548864170395.png/x5FjCu6jfF8bGWwNK-1Bw5fn_enSAO6h1NcH_NTXB_w\"/><figcaption>謝安琪曬出全家福。（IG@kaytse）</figcaption></figure><p>謝安琪送大仔返澳洲心情低落</p><p>謝安琪日前在Instagram發文，回顧今個10月的大小事。謝安琪分享一張與大仔和細女的搞怪合照，三人身處機場，謝安琪和子女以搞鬼表情合照，張瞻狀態不錯，看來在澳洲生活得頗好。</p><p>謝安琪坦言每次送仔仔去機場都心情低落，但已不那麼容易喊，她說：「又係送哥哥去機場的日子 每次都係會心情低落 不過而家已經唔會再咁容易喊 仲可以搞吓氣氛扮得意㖭 我哋三個就係KaBall仔、KayBall仔、JimBall仔」。</p><figure><img alt=\"謝安琪又送大仔返澳洲。（IG@kaytse）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196858574018580480517962.png/SWBOIR_SvgPnVvm2y4ImbO_AZLoe_6DMnSJ4zZ0ieM0\"/><figcaption>謝安琪又送大仔返澳洲。（IG@kaytse）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"謝安琪坦言每次送大仔返學都心情低落。（IG@kaytse）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196858571833217024365018.png/S9qvkFZlXyUquJoODF0SohIiseMJ6XQuX_Xs2V_17Nk\"/><figcaption>謝安琪坦言每次送大仔返學都心情低落。（IG@kaytse）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"謝安琪分享與余安安合照。（IG@kaytse）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196858584185966592732196.png/B8rYKarBG8Z3ch2ACQF1sXh311RmRUSe4B34G-Ad-Bs\"/><figcaption>謝安琪分享與余安安合照。（IG@kaytse）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"謝安琪電髮。（IG@kaytse）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196858581665058816485976.png/R-xaJmsn0ZkhSsBaykJILX_MVhdHSKqnixDAJIsQwCQ\"/><figcaption>謝安琪電髮。（IG@kaytse）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"謝安琪分享10月瑣事。（IG@kaytse）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196858579009933312607538.png/2KcXW3qK5KTPOstqRoAVqgRXZiOxmeDzECsdexArHXs\"/><figcaption>謝安琪分享10月瑣事。（IG@kaytse）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"謝安琪與張繼聰好恩愛。（IG@kaytse）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196858576359002112102945.png/FJnTsMxQdQR1MJO8ql7DqPK2l_xnXewy3R70RN0e9EQ\"/><figcaption>謝安琪與張繼聰好恩愛。（IG@kaytse）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"謝安琪分享10月大小事。（IG@kaytse）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196858573624184832956218.png/55BOM1fS4kPD_k0UDBFkJTP3xG5oRi-qoKSQaaCkkGk\"/><figcaption>謝安琪分享10月大小事。（IG@kaytse）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T05:53:15.465416+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":648,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T05:30:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T07:28:04.041798+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T05:46:50.372515+00:00","content_hash":"185eea0d62c7935d38f9e929747dedd2c76013b363b8afbebd69e20dba949a1b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}